<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 438)</h2>
<p><b>The whole review as one QuickTime.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>File ▸ Export Movie ▸ <b>Whole Session Reel…</b> renders the entire playlist in order — every clip through its own grade, looks, and input space, with its own marks and subtitles, and the picture holding while each voice note plays. One movie, one audio track: "here's last night's review" as a single file anyone can watch.</li>
<li>Clips of different sizes letterbox cleanly; clips of different frame rates keep their own timing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
